<section class="sec" id="win"><div class="wrap"><div class="mf-head rv"><h2 class="h2">Win the asset, win the front page</h2><p class="sub">On every asset, the analyst with the most Olives holds the D1 seat. He’s the first analyst investors see when they look up the asset. The D1 analyst also earns a share of the trading fees on that asset.</p></div><div class="stagebox" data-w="1120" data-h="625" data-trim="8"><div class="stage" style="width:1120px;height:625px;"><div class="mock wide" style="left:175px;top:20px;width:770px;"><img src="/images/v2/d1.jpg" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: the D1 seat on an asset page" style="width:770px;border-radius:12px" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div> <div class="spot" aria-hidden="true" style="left:766px;top:354px;width:62px;height:41px;border-radius:10px"><span class="badge">1</span></div> <div class="spot" aria-hidden="true" style="left:395px;top:192px;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%"><span class="badge">2</span></div> <div class="spot" aria-hidden="true" style="left:534px;top:74px;width:105px;height:29px;border-radius:10px"><span class="badge">3</span></div><div class="fpd" style="left:830px;top:8px;"><div class="hd"><span class="num">1</span><span class="tt">Earn Olives</span></div><div class="bb">Your Olives on an asset set your place on its leaderboard. John Maven AI holds every unclaimed seat, but never earns Olives: the first analyst who does takes it from him.</div></div><div class="fpd" style="left:10px;top:172px;"><div class="hd"><span class="num">2</span><span class="tt">Take the top seat</span></div><div class="bb">Lead an asset in Olives and your page becomes its front page. Claim an open seat, and everyone after you has to out-reason you.</div></div><div class="fpd dark" style="left:830px;top:400px;"><div class="hd"><span class="num">3</span><span class="tt">Earn on its trades</span></div><div class="bb">The D1 analyst earns a share of the trading fee on that asset, except on trades placed from another analyst’s Valuation.</div><div class="big"><span>10%</span><span>of the trading fee</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
